"xumisun-q-9139e7889aa6ebada22a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["xumisun-q-9139e7889aa6ebada22a"]},"ordering_evidence":"xumisun-q-9139e7889aa6ebada22a","source_order":[38,35,22],"order":7023},{"id":"yaoci-e-o073","title":"袁徽致荀彧书论士燮经学及条长义之意","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-d28652ac21c51114d167","label":"正文","text":"陈国袁徽与尚书令荀彧书，盛称交阯士府君学问优博、达于从政、处大乱保全一郡、二十余年疆埸无事，虽窦融保河西曷以加之","evidence":["yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-72267861043bb75bb2d4","label":"正文","text":"袁徽书又言：“今欲条《左氏》《尚书》长义上之。”","evidence":["yaoci-q-5303fcecba3618dea5b5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xumisun-p0016","role":"致书称许士燮者","evidence":["yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e","yaoci-q-5303fcecba3618dea5b5"]},{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"受书者","evidence":["yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e","yaoci-q-5303fcecba3618dea5b5"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e","source_order":[49,179,0],"order":8988}],"persons":[{"id":"xumisun-p0016","name":"袁徽","evidence":["xumisun-q-9139e7889aa6ebada22a","yuanzhang-q-53719933d096995fdf99","yuanzhang-q-feb15fd21699a869f0ce","yuanzhang-q-6c348ded31d787c5a315","yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e","yaoci-q-5303fcecba3618dea5b5"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xumisun-q-9139e7889aa6ebada22a","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-7276d270a642d9aa5804","layer":"original","quote":"陈国袁徽已寄寓交州〖5〗，徽与尚书令荀彧书曰：“许文休，英才伟士，智略足以计事。自流宕以来〖6〗，与群士相随；每有患急，常先人后己，与九族中外同其饥寒〖7〗。其纪纲同类〖8〗，仁恕恻隐，皆有效事〖9〗，不能复一二陈之耳","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":131},{"id":"xumisun-q2-bc89bb77e2e82b5f1918","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-7276d270a642d9aa5804","layer":"original","quote":"既至交阯〖3〗，交阯太守士燮厚加敬待〖4〗。陈国袁徽已寄寓交州〖5〗，徽与尚书令荀彧书曰：“许文休，英才伟士，智略足以计事。自流宕以来〖6〗，与群士相随；每有患急，常先人后己，与九族中外同其饥寒〖7〗。其纪纲同类〖8〗，仁恕恻隐，皆有效事〖9〗，不能复一二陈之耳〖10〗。”","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":137},{"id":"yaoci-q-5303fcecba3618dea5b5","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-449c4a0935ed3c963f18","layer":"original","quote":"闻京师古今之学，是非忿争；今欲条《左氏》、《尚书》长义，上之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":158,"end":188},{"id":"yaoci-q-95d2a368c0634921fd6e","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-449c4a0935ed3c963f18","layer":"original","quote":"陈国袁徽与尚书令荀彧书曰〖16〗：“交阯士府君，既学问优博，又达于从政；处大乱之中，保全一郡。二十余年疆埸无事〖17〗，民不失业；羇旅之徒，皆蒙其庆：虽窦融保河西，曷以加之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-53719933d096995fdf99","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-395deda2481618aa15f6","layer":"original","quote":"遭天下乱，避难交州","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":112,"end":121},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6c348ded31d787c5a315","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-b51295ae65d0c7634615","layer":"pei","quote":"初，天下将乱，涣慨然叹曰：‘汉室陵迟，乱无日矣！苟天下扰攘，逃将安之？若天未丧道，民以义存；唯强而有礼，可以庇身乎！’徽曰：‘古人有言，“知机其神乎”，“见机而作”，君子所以元吉也。天理盛衰，汉其亡矣！夫有大功必有大事，此又君子之所深识，退藏于密者也。且兵革既兴，外患必众；徽将远迹山海，以求免身。’及乱作，各行其志","attribution":"裴注·汉纪","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":79,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-67734e052955b9c2486d","start":12,"end":170},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-feb15fd21699a869f0ce","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-395deda2481618aa15f6","layer":"original","quote":"司徒辟，不至","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":125,"end":131}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
